348	    /**
349	     * Handles {@link CityAtCapacityException} raised when a create request supplies a
350	     * {@code city} that already contains the maximum number of owners (compared
351	     * case-insensitively). Returns a 409 Conflict whose body carries an {@code errors}
352	     * array naming the {@code city} field.
353	     *
354	     * @param e The {@link CityAtCapacityException} to be handled
355	     * @param request {@link HttpServletRequest} object referring to the current request.
356	     * @return A {@link ResponseEntity} containing the error information and a 409 Conflict status.
