371	    /**
372	     * Handles {@link DailyOwnerLimitExceededException} raised when a create request arrives
373	     * after the maximum number of owners for the current day (counted by
374	     * {@code registrationDate}) has already been reached. Returns a 429 Too Many Requests.
375	     *
376	     * @param e The {@link DailyOwnerLimitExceededException} to be handled
377	     * @param request {@link HttpServletRequest} object referring to the current request.
